Third-Party Dependencies:

This repository is a thin wrapper (DvMmu.cpp/.hpp, MemModel.hpp, sample.cpp)
around the following third-party component, which is included as a git submodule
and retains its own upstream license. Consult the upstream project for full
terms; the license identifier below should be verified by OSPO/legal before
public release.

- Whisper (whisper/)
  RISC-V instruction-set simulator; this project uses its VirtMem, PmpManager,
  and PmaManager as the address-translation reference model.
  Upstream: https://github.com/tenstorrent/whisper
  License: verify with upstream.
